 "bodyHtml": "<a class=\"wd-skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<h1 id=\"make-pasta\">Make pasta</h1>\n<p>Press a step to read it. Trust this document to turn the buttons on.</p>\n\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"step\":1}</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"now\":\"Boil salted water.\"}</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"hot\":false}</script>\n<button type=\"button\" data-wd-actions=\"[{&quot;op&quot;:&quot;set&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;step&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:1},{&quot;op&quot;:&quot;set&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;now&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Boil salted water.&quot;}]\">Step 1</button>\n<button type=\"button\" data-wd-actions=\"[{&quot;op&quot;:&quot;set&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;step&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:2},{&quot;op&quot;:&quot;set&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;now&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Add the pasta and cook for nine minutes.&quot;}]\">Step 2</button>\n<button type=\"button\" data-wd-actions=\"[{&quot;op&quot;:&quot;set&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;step&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:3},{&quot;op&quot;:&quot;set&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;now&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Drain, and keep a cup of the water.&quot;}]\">Step 3</button>\n<button type=\"button\" data-wd-actions=\"[{&quot;op&quot;:&quot;set&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;step&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:4},{&quot;op&quot;:&quot;set&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;now&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Toss with the sauce and serve.&quot;}]\">Step 4</button>\n<p><strong>Step <span data-wd-bind=\"step\">1</span> of 4:</strong> <span data-wd-bind=\"now\">Boil salted water.</span></p>\n\n<button type=\"button\" data-wd-action=\"toggle\" data-wd-target=\"hot\">Switch the stove</button>\n<p>Stove on: <span data-wd-bind=\"hot\">false</span></p>\n<p>The current step is temporary preview state. It returns to step 1 when the document is reopened.</p>\n\n</main>\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"/__wd/runtime.js\"></script>",
